    "curated_prompt": "A table inside tbody without thead can acquire an unwanted empty header.\n\nWhen there is no explicit thead and the first row contains td cells, that first row should be used as the Markdown header row. It should not be preceded by an empty header row.\n\n```python\nfrom markdownify import markdownify as md\n\nhtml = '<table><tbody><tr><td>Firstname</td><td>Lastname</td><td>Age</td></tr><tr><td>Jill</td><td>Smith</td><td>50</td></tr></tbody></table>'\nprint(md(html))\n```\n\nThe table should begin with:\n\n```\n| Firstname | Lastname | Age |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jill | Smith | 50 |\n```\n\nThe current output inserts an empty header and its separator before the Firstname row.\n",
